sequenceDiagram
    participant User
    participant NGINX
    participant Socket as Unix Socket
    participant PHP_FPM as PHP-FPM
    participant FileSystem as File System

    User->>NGINX: Request page.php
    Note over NGINX: Matches location ~ \.php$
    
    NGINX->>FileSystem: Check if file exists
    FileSystem-->>NGINX: File found
    
    NGINX->>Socket: Forward request via<br/>fastcgi_pass
    Socket->>PHP_FPM: Pass request
    
    PHP_FPM->>FileSystem: Read PHP file
    FileSystem-->>PHP_FPM: Return file content
    
    Note over PHP_FPM: Process PHP code
    
    PHP_FPM-->>Socket: Return processed result
    Socket-->>NGINX: Pass result
    NGINX-->>User: Send HTML response

    Note over User,NGINX: If file not found:<br/>Return 404 error
